code_combo/a251c730/25/code.py:27:#       solver must first notice that yellow and maroon never occur in the target and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/898e7135/D4/0/code.py:18:#    - Example: if a slot is an L-shape of 3 cells and k=2, the input piece is a 6-cell\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D6/0/code.py:31:#    在同一列/行内互相覆盖。矩形整体在两个开口朝向的边上都保留至少 3 格外部空间，保证辐射可见。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/898e7135/D7/1/code.py:20:#     - 例：框内有 3 个 L 形洞和 1 个单位洞，框外只有 1 个 L 形精灵和 1 个单位方块。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/898e7135/D7/1/code.py:22:#     - 新逻辑：第一个 L 洞和第二个/第三个 L 洞都映射到同一个 canonical L-shape class，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/898e7135/D7/1/code.py:23:#       每个洞各自选取该精灵的一个 D4 朝向并粘贴到输出，因此同色 L 形会在输出里出现多次。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D8/0/code.py:316:    - Use the wall endpoints to infer the opening direction, flood-fill the reachable interior/radiate zone with the seed color, and apply obstacle shadows along that same direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/898e7135/D14/1/code.py:24:#     - 原题：某个 L 形块只需通过外轮廓与 L 形洞匹配，朝向完全由洞形状决定\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/898e7135/D14/1/code.py:25:#     - 变体：两个槽位可以拥有相同的 L 形外轮廓，但红格位于不同拐角；外部也有两个同形\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/898e7135/D14/1/code.py:26:#       不同红点位置、不同颜色的 L 形精灵。此时仅靠形状无法决定“哪一块进哪一个槽位”，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/898e7135/D7/2/code.py:26:    - Original: slots = {L-shape area 3, unit area 1}, pieces = {3x-scaled L,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D2/3/code.py:11:#     - 单色组件完全不变：映射为框内的纯色直线或 L 形曼哈顿路径。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D8/2/code.py:10:#     - The wall endpoints still determine the opening direction and the two outward boundary rays.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D14/0/code.py:12:      The original solver uses the wall endpoints to define the opening direction and then\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D14/0/code.py:33:      needs to infer wall color, find the correct wall component, determine the opening direction,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D14/0/code.py:202:    - Then fill the mouth and extend a straight radiation strip outward in the opening direction;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D14/0/code.py:204:    - Obstacles cast background shadows behind themselves along that same opening direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D14/0/code.py:206:    Key insight: The endpoints still reveal the opening direction, but the important quantity in\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D2/2/code.py:230:    - Each ring-touching component still determines the same Manhattan stripe or L-shaped skeleton as in the base task.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D10/1/code.py:348:    - Infer each wall component's opening direction from its endpoints, then sort the sprites by how close that opening is to the corresponding grid edge.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D1/2/code.py:323:    Key insight: The wall endpoints still reveal the opening direction, but the interior action changes from area filling to boundary tracing; only the exterior side remains a solid radiation zone.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a251c730/37/code.py:24:#       - L 形 -> flip_h\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a251c730/37/code.py:31:#       - 本题：红色 L 形 + 右侧方向像素，且定位点位于右下象限\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D7/0/code.py:371:    - Then move each isolated pixel toward the border indicated by the opening direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a251c730/7/code.py:35:#       T0 = L 形连接器，(anchor=红, decor=黄)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a251c730/7/code.py:37:#       T2 = L 形连接器，(anchor=红, decor=蓝)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D3/0/code.py:569:    - The wall endpoints determine both the opening direction and where the periodic trajectory begins; once the fill crosses that opening, color depends on depth-band position rather than a single uniform paint color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D7/1/code.py:502:    - First flood-fill the reachable interior and outward radiate zone with the seed color, using the wall endpoints to define the opening direction exactly as in the base task.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D3/1/code.py:36:#     - 继续沿用原题墙体几何与放置函数，保证 8 连通、恰好 2 个端点、开口朝向明确。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D4/0/code.py:18:#    - The control pixel sits on the border that matches the opening direction, but outside the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D4/0/code.py:47:#    - Its side matches the opening direction, so a human can relate the remote control marker to the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D12/1/code.py:48:#    - A single global \"rad\" assumes one opening direction for the whole task. In the variant,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D1/2/code.py:32:#      band. Those domains collide even when the original L-shapes would not.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D4/3/code.py:76:    Key insight: The endpoints still reveal the opening direction, but the fill source is no longer inside the pocket; it is encoded by the lone wall-touching marker pixel.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D17/3/code.py:152:    assert rad != (0, 0), \"opening direction must be cardinal\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D17/3/code.py:251:      red keeps the original slanted ray, blue projects a straight ray along the opening direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/dbff022c/D13/1/code.py:16:#       - L 形孔洞（允许旋转） -> 固定填充为橙色(7)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/dbff022c/D13/1/code.py:20:#       2. L 形孔：孔洞等于“某一整行 + 某一整列”的并集，允许四种旋转。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/dbff022c/D13/1/code.py:22:#     - 每个样例至少包含一个矩形孔和一个 L 形孔，并且第三个精灵重复其中一类，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/dbff022c/D13/1/code.py:147:    - Classify each enclosed cavity by its own shape: a full rectangular bbox gets one fill color, an L-shaped cavity gets another.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/dbff022c/D13/1/code.py:176:    \"\"\"Return a rotated L-shaped hole mask.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/b9e38dc0/D15/1/code.py:17:#    The original task finds one wall component, infers the opening direction,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D3/3/code.py:29:#   original: an outside L-shape touched top + left ring cells, so the solver chose an inside elbow\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D10/0/code.py:39:#       L-shapes with exactly one touch on each of those side families.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D7/0/code.py:18:#    ring-touching open rectangle, always an L-shaped component whose two free\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D7/0/code.py:47:#    L-shaped open rectangle whose cells stay on background, remain in-bounds,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D10/1/code.py:597:    # Place L-shaped components in random corners\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D10/2/code.py:243:    - Monochrome components still create solid stripes or L-shaped Manhattan links between their mapped touch points.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D7/1/code.py:19:#    L-shaped rectangular traces instead of only 2-3 components. Each outside\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D7/1/code.py:41:#      it; all primary components are L-shapes with two adjacent frame sides.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/18/code.py:9:#    - 每个蓝色块不再是对称菱形，而是实心 L 形：其 bbox 内恰好缺失一个角落矩形，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/18/code.py:11:#    - 发射口不再由绿色标记给出，而是由 L 形短臂末端那条最窄边隐式决定；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/18/code.py:15:#      “向右发射”。本融合版里，同样位置换成一个 L 形块：上来的射线先命中 L 块，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/18/code.py:20:#    - 若只删除绿色而保留对称块，则方向不可判；若 L 形参数完全自由，则样例难以归纳。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/18/code.py:22:#      每个模板都等于“满矩形减去一个角落矩形”，既明显是 L 形，又稳定产生唯一窄边。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/18/code.py:28:#    - 原生成器默认只需避开实际蓝像素；L 形带