o/5961cc34/18/code.py:469:    # --- STEP 5) BFS propagate: every activated L-shape emits from its hidden port ---\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/18/code.py:610:    \"\"\"Place one off-path distractor L-shape if space exists.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D4/2/code.py:61:#   the interior, while the L-shaped completion from another object clearly terminates\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D7/2/code.py:60:# - Meaningful ring-touching components are L-shaped and touch one horizontal and one vertical\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/25/code.py:24:#     * orange body (7) -> maroon interior (9) after activation\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/25/code.py:34:#     D15-only output: A becomes solid pink, B solid maroon.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/25/code.py:36:#                   orange-rimmed with maroon interior; rays remain red.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/25/code.py:79:#     orange blob -> orange rim + maroon fill\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/25/code.py:104:    7: 9,  # orange -> maroon\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D15/0/code.py:160:    - Each outside component contributes projected touch points inside the frame and becomes a straight stripe or an L-shaped Manhattan path.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/62593bfd/D5/0/code.py:25:#      original: two same-color-distinct L-shapes, one upright and one lying\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D13/0/code.py:8:#    - L-shaped outside components still map to one interior Manhattan L path.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a251c730/36/code.py:21:#    L-shaped trail between the two rectangles. The wallpaper itself changes from axial stripes to\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/62593bfd/D13/2/code.py:26:#     - 例：原题可同时出现一个 3 像素 L 形和一个 8 像素十字形，解题者可能先靠面积粗分。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a6f40cea/D13/1/code.py:39:#     - inner 仍用 used_inner 做占位检查，任