/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/62593bfd/D1/0/code.py:35:      - red L-shape, area 5, c0 = 3\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/62593bfd/D1/1/code.py:22:#   suppose input has red L-shape at c=2, red zigzag at c=10, blue T-shape at c=16.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/29/code.py:72:#    output contains whole rows or whole columns rather than corner L-shapes, so\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/62593bfd/D1/3/code.py:28:#     - Example base L-shape:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/62593bfd/D1/2/code.py:17:#         * A 2x3 L-shape and a 2x3 zigzag are different canonical shapes.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/25/code.py:331:    - Exactly one outer starter component touches the ring in two places and behaves like the original L-shaped source.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/62593bfd/D12/0/code.py:18:#   - Original flow: two L-shapes in red and blue share a canonical shape, so\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/62593bfd/D12/0/code.py:20:#   - Variant flow: those same two L-shapes are both orange. The solver can now\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/62593bfd/D12/1/code.py:28:#     - 例：输入里有一个红色 L 形，它和另一个蓝色 L 形同组，所以输出去顶部；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a25697e4/D4/3/code.py:7:# - Variant detail: 框架放置在网格内部而非边缘，工具同样在内部。对接方向由框架的开口朝向决定（而非边缘方向）。解题者需先判断框架的开口方向，增加空间推理步骤。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D4/3/code.py:120:    # Find marker: a non-bg color appearing exactly 3 times in a 2x2 L-shape.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D1/4/code.py:21:#       连接器连在主体边缘，方向可见，例如横向 2 格、竖向 2 格、L 形 3 格。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a251c730/D15/1/code.py:29:#         - 3 像素 L 形 `L./LL` -> flip_h\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D8/0/code.py:3:# Change: 3 像素 L 形标记（2x2 缺一角），使用独特颜色（仅出现 3 次），缺失角指示矩形的一个顶点... → 单像素标记+方向编码\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D8/0/code.py:14:#     - 旧题的 marker 是 3 像素 L 形，缺失格直接告诉 solver “哪个角是矩形角点”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/446ef5d2/D8/0/code.py:51:#     - 人类可见的变化是：