ode.py:165:    - The two L-shapes are same-color components; each has one elbow cell that acts as the marker's coordinate.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D1/3/code.py:170:    - Otherwise extract the elbow of each L-shape; cross the row from one elbow with the column from the other, and vice versa.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D1/3/code.py:216:            assert elbow is not None, \"normal marker components must be 3-cell L-shapes\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D1/2/code.py:3:# Change: diagonal_markers — 同色 L 形角标记位于外接矩形的对角，通过 L 形朝向判定哪条对角线是标记对角线、... → 大小编码匹配\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5545f144/23/code.py:415:    Advance an L-shaped sprite through a walled frame and return the final pose.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D18/1/code.py:2:# Dimension: D18 — L 形角的朝向判定逻辑 (meta)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D18/1/code.py:3:# Change: 通过检测哪两个角有 L 形锚点来确定标记对角线方向（TL+BR 得分 vs TR+BL 得分）... → 额外的方向标记像素\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D18/1/code.py:32:    - 原 `_l_pair_valid_bbox()` 的 tie-avoidance 仍然有价值，因为 solver 仍需识别两个角上的 L 形模板；因此保留安全 bbox 家族。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D18/1/code.py:102:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D18/1/code.py:293:    - Most legend markers appear as two opposite L-shaped corners plus one separate same-color direction pixel on the bbox edge.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D1/4/code.py:3:# Change: diagonal_markers — 同色 L 形角标记位于外接矩形的对角，通过 L 形朝向判定哪条对角线是标记对角线、... → 镜像对称匹配\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D11/0/code.py:3:# Change: 0-1 个干扰 L 对（使用非图例颜色的 L 形角标记），解题者需忽略非图例色的标记... → 无干扰项\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D11/0/code.py:33:#     - The visible corner markers remain L-shaped 3-pixel anchors placed on one bbox\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D11/0/code.py:111:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D11/0/code.py:158:    - A marker is either a pair of opposite L-shaped corners or a solid 2x2 block of one legend color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D6/0/code.py:101:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D16/1/code.py:120:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88e364bc/D9/2/code.py:43:     L-shaped move is modeled as a jump.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D11/1/code.py:3:# Change: 0-1 个干扰 L 对（使用非图例颜色的 L 形角标记），解题者需忽略非图例色的标记... → 多个干扰 L 对（2-3 个）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D11/1/code.py:20:#   orange, maroon, and grey fake pairs at once. The fill output should still be computed only from\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D11/1/code.py:82:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D6/1/code.py:18:#     - 非图例区仍然是 L 形对角标记对，或少量 2x2 实心块。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D6/1/code.py:86:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/247ef758/34/code.py:37:#   - Each mover is a 2x2 asymmetric L-shape. Its exact silhouette is carved as\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/247ef758/34/code.py:47:#       a green L-shape on the left no longer has any green pixels on frames.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/247ef758/34/code.py:48:#       Instead, one frame has that same L-shape cut into its left/right edges\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/247ef758/34/code.py:61:#   - Three distinct L-shapes are enough for 2-3 movers without ambiguity, and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/247ef758/34/code.py:62:#     the optional distractor can use the remaining unused L-shape.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D11/3/code.py:3:# Change: 0-1 个干扰 L 对（使用非图例颜色的 L 形角标记），解题者需忽略非图例色的标记... → 散落的单色像素干扰\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D11/3/code.py:18:#       - 有效对象仍只有两类：两端各 3 像素的 L 形对角角标，或一个 2x2 实心块。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D6/3/code.py:37:#   allowed between filled diamonds, not between the visible L-shapes themselves.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D6/3/code.py:99:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D6/3/code.py:243:    - Non-legend pixels of a marker color form either two L-shaped opposite corners of a bounding box or one solid 2x2 block.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D3/0/code.py:116:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D11/2/code.py:3:# Change: 0-1 个干扰 L 对（使用非图例颜色的 L 形角标记），解题者需忽略非图例色的标记... → 干扰使用图例中存在的颜色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D11/2/code.py:312:    - A true L-pair color may also have extra L-shaped corners in the same color, but those extras are not positioned\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D6/2/code.py:90:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D3/1/code.py:9:#       - 非图例区域仍放置与图例颜色对应的 L 形对角角标，少量条目仍可为空操作或 2x2 实心块。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D3/1/code.py:12:#       - L 形对角角标围成一个轴对齐 bbox 后，原题会把整个 bbox 内部都染成图例颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D3/1/code.py:81:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D3/1/code.py:111:    - Away from the legend, each active marker color appears either as two L-shaped corner markers on one bbox diagonal or as a solid 2x2 block.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D7/0/code.py:98:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D3/3/code.py:116:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D3/3/code.py:178:    - Outside the legend, each active marker color appears either as two diagonal L-shaped corners\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D7/1/code.py:118:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D5/0/code.py:210:L_LAYOUT_MAX_SPAN = 24            # max legend line span for L-shaped layouts\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D5/0/code.py:377:    \"\"\"Place an L-shaped divider with legend panel in one corner.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D3/2/code.py:110:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D3/2/code.py:199:    - Away from the legend, a marker color appears either as two opposite L-shaped corners of one bounding box or as a solid 2x2 block.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/25/code.py:361:    Flood-fill a corner-open enclosure and move isolated pixels along the same diagonal opening direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D7/2/code.py:85:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D5/3/code.py:283:    \"\"\"Place an L-shaped divider with the legend stack in one corner panel.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D10/0/code.py:103:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/247ef758/12/code.py:14:# - 具体小例子: interior 行列为 `1..8`，某 3x3 L 形精灵像素相对左上角为\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/26/code.py:34:#      opening direction, so the puzzle still has a compact visual vocabulary.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/26/code.py:504:    - Infer each wall component's opening direction from its endpoints and sort the components by how close that opening is to the corresponding grid edge.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D17/0/code.py:126:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D5/2/code.py:326:    \"\"\"Place an L-shaped divider with a corner panel.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D10/1/code.py:121:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D10/1/code.py:177:    - The legend tells you the color mapping, while the L-shapes tell you which diagonal is marked;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88e364bc/D6/1/code.py:27:      - variant case: an L-shape moving right has a short upper branch and a long lower branch;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/31/code.py:36:#    The new geometry has only four opening directions and one clear family of shapes, so the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/31/code.py:62:#    missing side toward one grid edge, so the opening direction is explicit in the pixels.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/31/code.py:348:    - Apply obstacle shadows along that same opening direction, then erase the full rectangular wall component back to background so only the fill mass, outward strip, and untouched obstacles remain.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D17/1/code.py:97:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88e364bc/D1/2/code.py:11:#      - Diagonal directions use a 4x4 L-shaped path.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88e364bc/D1/2/code.py:139:    \"\"\"Create a strip or L-shaped legend using the fixed sequence C,C,C,1,1,2,2.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88e364bc/D1/2/code.py:450:    At least one legend is always diagonal/L-shaped. This is a deliberate observability guard:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D10/2/code.py:108:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5dbc8537/D4/1/code.py:43:#     - 非点状 patch 统一采用双颜色、带固定朝向的角标 L 形图案，避免纯色或旋转对称导致“转了也看不出来”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5dbc8537/D4/1/code.py:56:#     - 角度分支只有 3 类，并且在每个样例里重复出现；输入和输出都能直接看到 L 形角标在转向。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5dbc8537/D4/1/code.py:58:#     - patch 图案采用简洁的角标 L 形，不引入额外叠层或符号。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/db695cfb/D6/2/code.py:15:#    - This variant replaces each endpoint-pair with a 3-cell blue L-shaped arrow sprite.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/db695cfb/D6/2/code.py:53:#    - Humans can see the L-shaped blue sprite and its missing diagonal quadrant directly.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/db695cfb/D6/2/code.py:162:    - bg = most common color. Blue source objects are 3-cell L-shaped arrows; the corner cell is the tip.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/27/code.py:81:    - Recover the same interior-plus-radiated reachable region as in the base task, using the wall endpoints to infer the opening direction and using obstacles to cast shadows.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D4/0/code.py:116:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/8/code.py:422:    - Recover the same reachable region as in the original task, using the wall endpoints to infer the opening direction and applying obstacle shadows along that direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D2/0/code.py:358:    \"\"\"Place an L-shaped divider with the legend panel in one corner.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D12/0/code.py:8:#     - 每个真正出现的 marker_color 现在只能对应一个 L 形角对：两个 3 像素 L 角坐落在同一个轴对齐 bbox 的对角上。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D12/0/code.py:111:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D4/1/code.py:107:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D4/1/code.py:144:    - Elsewhere, each marker color appears either as two opposite L-shaped bbox corners or as a solid 2x2 block.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/24/code.py:48:#    - In every sample, both walls have the same border color and the same opening direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D12/2/code.py:125:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D13/0/code.py:42:#      without overlap and still use the same L-shape conventions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D13/0/code.py:112:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D8/3/code.py:352:    \"\"\"Place an L-shaped divider with legend panel in one corner.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/1/code.py:119:    assert rad != (0, 0), \"expected a cardinal opening direction\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/1/code.py:145:      wall opening direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D13/1/code.py:134:    Marker corners are L-shapes:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9385bd28/D13/1/code.py:306:    - Outside the legend, each marker color appears either as two L-shaped opposite corners of a bbox or as a solid 2x2 block.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/3/code.py:609:    - First flood-fill the reachable interior and outward radiate zone with the seed color, using the wall endpoints to define the opening direction exactly as in the base task.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/fc7cae8d/D2/2/code.py:24:#    the solver could simply slice away one full row/col. Here the output core is an L-shape:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/fc7cae8d/D2/2/code.py:33:#    A corner-notch L-shape is visibly non-rectangular in every sample because the output bbox\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/fc7cae8d/D2/2/code.py:188:    The object is now an irregular L-shape whose guide colors follow the object's\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/4/code.py:12:    divider: still a full row / full column / L-shaped separator\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/4/code.py:35:        legend red = skewed F-shape, legend green = bent L-shape\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/11/code.py:215:    - Use the wall endpoints to infer the opening direction and extend two boundary rays outward from them.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/5/code.py:22:#     - divider and legend panel layouts remain horizontal / vertical / L-shaped\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D1/5/code.py:355:    \"\"\"Place an L-shaped divider with legend panel in one corner.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/7/code.py:394:    - Trace the two wedge-boundary rays in the opening direction, but stop each ray immediately before it would touch another wall sprite instead of extending it to the grid edge.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/35/code.py:43:#    - 生成器沿用原题墙体构造器，保证单个 8 连通 wall、恰好两个度 1 端点、开口朝向明确。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/35/code.py:590:    - The background is the most common color. The most frequent non-background color is one wall component that forms a partial enclosure with a single opening direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/35/code.py:591:    - A nearby non-wall color is the fill seed inside that enclosure. Any other non-background singleton pixels are movers that will travel in the same opening direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/35/code.py:594:    - First remove each mover from its start cell and send it straight along the opening direction all the way to the grid edge without stopping for the wall or the future filled plume, clearing each travelled non-wall cell to background.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D3/2/code.py:219:    - The top-left corner contains a legend panel fenced by an L-shaped divider.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D3/2/code.py:266:    \"\"\"Place the fixed top-left legend panel and its L-shaped divider.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D12/2/code.py:353:    \"\"\"Place an L-shaped divider with legend panel in one corner.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/17/code.py:69:    - Past the neck mouth, the fill keeps moving along the opening direction, but its allowed width grows stepwise: both side boundaries move sideways by one cell every two forward steps, producing a cone.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D4/0/code.py:351:    \"\"\"Place an L-shaped divider with legend panel in one corner.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/97d7923e/D5/3/code.py:26:       new: cap color 4 with an L-shaped legend glyph -> choose 2nd longest bar capped by 4.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D4/1/code.py:180:L_LAYOUT_MAX_SPAN = 24            # max legend line span for L-shaped layouts\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D4/1/code.py:339:    \"\"\"Place an L-shaped divider with legend panel in one corner.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/39/code.py:26:#      opening direction toward the corresponding grid edge, leaving their old cells as background.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/39/code.py:201:    assert rad != (0, 0), \"expected a non-zero opening direction\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/39/code.py:355:    - Then move each isolated singleton straight along the same opening direction by exactly half of its own current\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D4/3/code.py:194:L_LAYOUT_MAX_SPAN = 24            # max legend line span for L-shaped layouts\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D4/3/code.py:362:    \"\"\"Place an L-shaped divider with legend panel in one corner.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/332f06d7/D11/2/code.py:35:# - 障碍形状只用非实心方形的小多连块（骨牌、L 形、三连条），避免和 mover/dest\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D4/2/code.py:160:L_LAYOUT_MAX_SPAN = 24             # max legend line span for L-shaped layouts\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D4/2/code.py:319:    \"\"\"Place an L-shaped divider with legend panel in one corner.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/25/code.py:328:    adds a global quarter-turn, while the little L-shaped seed around each source\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D4/4/code.py:331:    \"\"\"Place an L-shaped divider with legend panel in one corner.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/31/code.py:36:#      maroon} has count 4 instead, so it matches the red count-4 rule and stamps\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/19/code.py:342:    Key insight: Even with a serrated border, the two degree-1 tips still expose the opening direction; the crucial change is to separate \"reachable interior\" from \"cells that actually touch the wall\" so the pocket becomes an outline instead of a filled blob.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D14/0/code.py:362:    \"\"\"Place an L-shaped divider with legend panel in one corner.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D14/1/code.py:416:    \"\"\"Place an L-shaped divider with legend panel in one corner.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/5/code.py:478:    - The wall geometry still reveals the opening direction, but the stopping distance is no longer\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/1/code.py:26:#        combo: green L-shape -> red pixel + teal shape => every other L-shape stamps red,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/1/code.py:27:#        even when those L-shapes are yellow or maroon.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D11/2/code.py:400:    \"\"\"Place an L-shaped divider with legend panel in one corner.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/11/code.py:91:# - Humans also see repeated L-shaped seeds of the same two colors. Comparing several\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/3e6067c3/D2/2/code.py:37:  picks B because distance wins, so the output contains an L-shaped bridge instead of\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D7/1/code.py:223:L_LAYOUT_MAX_SPAN = 24             # max legend line span for L-shaped layouts\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e3721c99/D7/1/code.py:387:    \"\"\"Place an L-shaped divider with legend panel in one corner.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/7/code.py:31:#       - old legend: red, then yellow, then a teal L-shape\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/7/code.py:32:#       - combo legend: red, then yellow, then a yellow L-shape plus e.g. one grey diagonal accent\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/13/code.py:502:    Key insight: The opening direction still comes from the wall endpoints, but singleton motion no longer follows that direction; it is a separate downward preprocessing step whose new resting positions affect the later radiation.\n/h